messages[5]{user,text}:
  user_1,Hi Neha I'm calling about my travel policy with DCoders It's expired and I need to know what to do next
  user_2,Ah Vivaan good afternoon I've checked on your policy and yes it has expired Let me see what options we have for you [pause] Okay I can offer you a new quote or we can discuss reinstating the old policy Which one would you prefer
  user_1,Actually I think I'd like to go with the new quote You'd already sent me one via email but I had a few more questions about the trip cancellation coverage
  user_2,Of course Vivaan Let me just pull up the quote real quick [typing] Okay I've got it here So you're wondering about trip cancellations due to medical emergencies
  user_1,Exactly And I also wanted to confirm if my hypertension would affect the premium at all